    {
      "id": "3bq71GrgRHtBP3dYELW-N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 495.5830403477696,
      "y": 18815.415984024046,
      "width": 759,
      "height": 775,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1371984225,
      "version": 13,
      "versionNonce": 935637871,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788875190712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Eventually, our project can look approximately like:\n\nenterprise_workspace/\n│\n├── manage.py\n│\n├── config/\n│   ├── settings.py\n│   ├── urls.py\n│   ├── asgi.py\n│   └── wsgi.py\n│\n├── apps/\n│   ├── users/\n│   ├── organizations/\n│   ├── teams/\n│   ├── projects/\n│   ├── tasks/\n│   ├── documents/\n│   ├── notifications/\n│   └── ai/\n│\n├── requirements/\n│\n├── Dockerfile\n│\n└── .env\n\nNotice something important:\nWe are not using Docker Compose, as you requested earlier.\nWe'll use Docker directly and later deploy the containers to AWS/EKS.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Eventually, our project can look approximately like:\n\nenterprise_workspace/\n│\n├── manage.py\n│\n├── config/\n│   ├── settings.py\n│   ├── urls.py\n│   ├── asgi.py\n│   └── wsgi.py\n│\n├── apps/\n│   ├── users/\n│   ├── organizations/\n│   ├── teams/\n│   ├── projects/\n│   ├── tasks/\n│   ├── documents/\n│   ├── notifications/\n│   └── ai/\n│\n├── requirements/\n│\n├── Dockerfile\n│\n└── .env\n\nNotice something important:\nWe are not using Docker Compose, as you requested earlier.\nWe'll use Docker directly and later deploy the containers to AWS/EKS.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YgBhQDC7ZkQOM-_g00wlT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 412.4619465977696,
      "y": 19651.415984024046,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1639552463,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 339285039,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788875206023,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Part 4 — First important design decision",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part 4 — First important design decision",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "CfRQ3czuP1NDew0aeJIm4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 462.4619465977696,
      "y": 19692.165984024046,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 110790113,
      "version": 37,
      "versionNonce": 1761104417,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788875311547,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Before creating our models, we need to decide:\nWhat should our User model look like?\n\nDjango gives us a default User model.\n\nBut for our project, I want you to understand why we should consider a custom User model from Day 1.\n\nOur requirements include:\n\nUser\n├── email\n├── password\n├── first_name\n├── last_name\n├── is_active\n├── created_at\n└── updated_at\n\nAnd potentially later:\n\nOAuth\nEmail verification\nProfile\nSecurity settings\nLogin history\n\nSo instead of tightly coupling ourselves to Django's default user implementation, we can \ndefine our own user model.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Before creating our models, we need to decide:\nWhat should our User model look like?\n\nDjango gives us a default User model.\n\nBut for our project, I want you to understand why we should consider a custom User model from Day 1.\n\nOur requirements include:\n\nUser\n├── email\n├── password\n├── first_name\n├── last_name\n├── is_active\n├── created_at\n└── updated_at\n\nAnd potentially later:\n\nOAuth\nEmail verification\nProfile\nSecurity settings\nLogin history\n\nSo instead of tightly coupling ourselves to Django's default user implementation, we can \ndefine our own user model.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jXx71G-mEWfK8bwT47cUf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 374.4619465977696,
      "y": 20479.415984024046,
      "width": 517,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1368955329,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 503743841,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788875326041,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Part 5 — Most important relationship from Day 2",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part 5 — Most important relationship from Day 2",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jLblLPTEz36yfj0helLJA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 427.5986653477696,
      "y": 20515.412077774046,
      "width": 748,
      "height": 1025,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2105298145,
      "version": 37,
      "versionNonce": 926246447,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788875413605,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Remember:\n\nUser\n   │\n   │ M:N\n   ▼\nOrganizationMember\n   │\n   ▼\nOrganization\n\nWe don't do:\nUser\n └── organization_id ❌\n\nbecause:\n\nAmit\n ├── Google\n ├── TechNova\n └── Personal Workspace\n\nInstead:\n\nUser\n  │\n  ├── OrganizationMember → Google\n  ├── OrganizationMember → TechNova\n  └── OrganizationMember → Personal\n\nAnd membership can contain:\n\nOrganizationMember\n-----------------------\nuser\norganization\nrole\nstatus\njoined_at\n\nThis is where our Day 2 database design directly becomes Django ORM.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Remember:\n\nUser\n   │\n   │ M:N\n   ▼\nOrganizationMember\n   │\n   ▼\nOrganization\n\nWe don't do:\nUser\n └── organization_id ❌\n\nbecause:\n\nAmit\n ├── Google\n ├── TechNova\n └── Personal Workspace\n\nInstead:\n\nUser\n  │\n  ├── OrganizationMember → Google\n  ├── OrganizationMember → TechNova\n  └── OrganizationMember → Personal\n\nAnd membership can contain:\n\nOrganizationMember\n-----------------------\nuser\norganization\nrole\nstatus\njoined_at\n\nThis is where our Day 2 database design directly becomes Django ORM.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "OdpeWs8TK5JsUdH3VCn1A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 645.4619465977696,
      "y": 20600.415984024046,
      "width": 11,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
